nd  according to this he feels a certain  fashion towards nude because he takes  care of various beasts and albus thinks  of himself as a beast who has done dark  things  we are definitely curious to see whether  jude law can convincingly portray  dumbledore's character in the third part  the cast of fantastic beasts 3 is  definitely worth seeing besides main  actor eddie redmayne's nudes commander  there are some old and new characters to  see these are shown particularly vividly  by the fantastic beasts twitter channel  ss published some pictures of the actors  on the course of the second trailer  included for example are as ramila as  credence barebone jude law as albus  dumbledore kathleen waterson as tina  goldstein allison soodle as queenie  ghost in callum turner as theseus  commander and then fogler as jacob  kowalski the most controversial  personnel by far is of course the  casting of matt's mickelson as the  villain gala grindelwald the dark wizard  was embodied by johnny depp in parts 1  and 2 and suspended by warner brothers  for the planned filming of the third  part in the course of his court case  against amber heard walnut brothers  feared bad coverage if they held on to  death and preferred to pay him the  contractually guaranteed 16 million  dollar fee instead of continuing to plan  with him it was quickly decided that  matt's mickelson would take deb's place  many fans agree that this was wasn't  equally successful casting but they  would have liked to see a fair approach  to johnny depp and his ex-wife amber  heard either way the demands on matt's  mickelson's grindelwald will be enormous  but the 56 year old dane was surely  aware of that beforehand  the filming of fantastic beasts the  secrets of dumbledore turned out to be  extremely difficult after they were  supposed to begin in summer 2019 they  were postponed until february 2020 when  the pandemic threw a spanner in the  works after further cancellations in the  meantime filming was not f